---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Terms & Conditions - Rong Pencil Art Academy"
  description="Read the terms of service, enrollment policy, refund policies, and code of conduct for students and visitors of Rong Pencil Art Academy."
  keywords="art academy terms of service, refund policy, student code of conduct, enrollment terms"
>
  <main>
    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <section class="bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-50 to-amber-50 py-20 px-4">
      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto text-center">
        <h1 class="text-5xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">Terms & Conditions</h1>
        <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
          Please read these terms and conditions carefully before using our services
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Terms Content -->
    <section class="py-20 px-4 bg-white">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
          <div class="mb-12">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">1. Introduction</h2>
            <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
              Welcome to Rong Pencil Art Academy. These terms and conditions outline the rules and regulations for the use of our website and services.
            </p>
            <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
              By accessing this website and enrolling in our courses, you agree to comply with and be bound by the following terms and conditions.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="mb-12">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">2. Enrollment & Admission</h2>
            <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
              Students must complete the enrollment process and pay the required fees before joining any course. The academy reserves the right to accept or reject any enrollment application.
            </p>
            <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
              All fees must be paid in full before the commencement of the course unless a payment plan has been agreed upon in writing.
            </p>
            <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
              Once enrolled, students are expected to attend all scheduled classes. Regular attendance is important for progress and completion of the course.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="mb-12">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">3. Fee Structure & Refund Policy</h2>
            <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
              Course fees are non-refundable once the course has commenced. In case of cancellation before the course starts, a 50% refund will be provided.
            </p>
            <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
              All fees are subject to change without prior notice. However, enrolled students will not be affected by fee increases during their current course duration.
            </p>
            <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
              Materials and supplies are included in the course fee unless otherwise specified. Additional materials may be required for advanced courses.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="mb-12">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">4. Code of Conduct</h2>
            <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
              Students are expected to maintain a respectful and professional attitude towards teachers, staff, and fellow students.
            </p>
            <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
              Any form of harassment, discrimination, or disruptive behavior will not be tolerated and may result in dismissal from the course without refund.
            </p>
            <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
              Students must take care of academy property and equipment. Any damage caused intentionally or through negligence will be charged to the student.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="mb-12">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">5. Attendance & Make-up Classes</h2>
            <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
              Students are expected to attend all scheduled classes. Regular attendance is important for learning progress.
            </p>
            <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
              Make-up classes may be provided for missed sessions at the discretion of the academy, subject to availability and valid reason for absence.
            </p>
            <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
              No refund or adjustment will be made for classes missed by the student without prior notice.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="mb-12">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">6. Intellectual Property</h2>
            <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
              All course materials, teaching methods, and content developed by Rong Pencil Art Academy are the intellectual property of the academy.
            </p>
            <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
              Students may not reproduce, distribute, or use academy materials for commercial purposes without written permission.
            </p>
            <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
              Artwork created by students during the course remains the property of the student, but the academy reserves the right to display such work for promotional purposes.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="mb-12">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">7. Health & Safety</h2>
            <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
              The academy maintains a safe learning environment. Students must follow all safety guidelines provided by instructors.
            </p>
            <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
              Parents/guardians are responsible for informing the academy of any medical conditions or allergies their children may have.
            </p>
            <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
              The academy is not liable for injuries or accidents that occur due to student negligence or failure to follow safety instructions.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="mb-12">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">8. Privacy Policy</h2>
            <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
              We collect and store personal information for enrollment and communication purposes only.
            </p>
            <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
              Your information will not be shared with third parties without your consent, except as required by law.
            </p>
            <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
              By enrolling, you agree to our privacy policy and the collection and use of your personal information as described.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="mb-12">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">9. Amendments</h2>
            <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
              Rong Pencil Art Academy reserves the right to amend these terms and conditions at any time. Changes will be communicated through the website or direct notice to enrolled students.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="mb-12">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">10. Contact Information</h2>
            <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
              For any questions regarding these terms and conditions, please contact us at:
            </p>
            <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
              Email: info@rongpencilart.com<br>
              Phone: +91 XXXXX XXXXX<br>
              Address: Kolsur, North 24 Pargana, West Bengal, India
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-amber-50 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-amber-200">
            <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm">
              Last updated: June 2026
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
